{"seq":3,"slug":"recall-action-refund-remedy","title":"停售/下架/回收/维修/退款执行","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-safety-incident-recall-gpsr/recall-execution/recall-action-refund-remedy","wordCount":1750,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"停售-下架-回收-维修-退款执行\">停售/下架/回收/维修/退款执行</h1><p>召回公告发布只是中途点，真正的成本与风险都在执行阶段：几千个订单要退款、几万件库存要处置、几百个仍在运输途中的包裹要拦截。执行阶段最容易出现的不是&quot;做不到&quot;，而是&quot;做乱了&quot;——退款重复发放、库存去向不明、已修复商品重新流入市场。这一篇讲的是把执行动作变成可对账的状态机。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-召回是一场对账\">核心概念：召回是一场对账</h2><p>召回执行的所有动作，最终都要回答同一个问题：<strong>每一件受影响的商品现在在哪里、处于什么状态</strong>。从工厂发出的那 12,000 件，减去已退回的、已销毁的、在途的、仍在消费者手中的，差额必须为零。做不到这一点，召回就无法向监管申请终止。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[受影响商品全量] --&gt; B{物理位置}&#10;  B --&gt;|渠道库存| C[冻结上架 -&gt; 退回/销毁]&#10;  B --&gt;|在途包裹| D[拦截 -&gt; 退回发货仓]&#10;  B --&gt;|消费者手中| E[通知 -&gt; 申请补救]&#10;  E --&gt; F{补救方式}&#10;  F --&gt;|退款| G[无需退回 -&gt; 直接退款]&#10;  F --&gt;|维修| H[寄回 -&gt; 修复 -&gt; 返还]&#10;  F --&gt;|换货| I[寄回 -&gt; 换发合格品]&#10;  D --&gt; J[回收品处置池]&#10;  C --&gt; J&#10;  H --&gt; J&#10;  I --&gt; J&#10;  J --&gt; K{处置方式}&#10;  K --&gt;|销毁| L[销毁证明归档]&#10;  K --&gt;|返工| M[返工后复检 -&gt; 重新入合格库存]&#10;  K --&gt;|退供应商| N[供应商责任追偿]\">graph TD\n  A[受影响商品全量] --&gt; B{物理位置}\n  B --&gt;|渠道库存| C[冻结上架 -&gt; 退回/销毁]\n  B --&gt;|在途包裹| D[拦截 -&gt; 退回发货仓]\n  B --&gt;|消费者手中| E[通知 -&gt; 申请补救]\n  E --&gt; F{补救方式}\n  F --&gt;|退款| G[无需退回 -&gt; 直接退款]\n  F --&gt;|维修| H[寄回 -&gt; 修复 -&gt; 返还]\n  F --&gt;|换货| I[寄回 -&gt; 换发合格品]\n  D --&gt; J[回收品处置池]\n  C --&gt; J\n  H --&gt; J\n  I --&gt; J\n  J --&gt; K{处置方式}\n  K --&gt;|销毁| L[销毁证明归档]\n  K --&gt;|返工| M[返工后复检 -&gt; 重新入合格库存]\n  K --&gt;|退供应商| N[供应商责任追偿]</pre><p>图中最容易出错的是 M 那条支线：返工商品重新入合格库存。如果没有强制的复检与再标识，返工品可能再次出问题，造成二次召回——这类重复召回对监管信任的打击远大于首次召回。</p>\n<h2 id=\"四个执行动作的落地要点\">四个执行动作的落地要点</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>动作</th>\n<th>触发时点</th>\n<th>关键约束</th>\n<th>对账口径</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>停售/下架</td>\n<td>决策当日</td>\n<td>全渠道同步，含三方市场</td>\n<td>下架 SKU 数 / 应下架数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>在途拦截</td>\n<td>决策后立即</td>\n<td>依赖承运商接口时效</td>\n<td>拦截成功件数 / 在途件数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>回收</td>\n<td>通知发出后</td>\n<td>回收点与逆向物流能力</td>\n<td>已回收件数 / 通知件数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>退款/维修/换货</td>\n<td>消费者申请后</td>\n<td>幂等，防重复发放</td>\n<td>已补救件数 / 申请件数</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第一行的&quot;含三方市场&quot;是跨境场景的常见漏洞：自家站点下架了，但同一 SKU 在多个第三方平台仍在售。合规上这属于未完成下架；工程上需要一个渠道清单与状态回执，而不能靠人工逐个平台确认。</p>\n<h3 id=\"在途拦截的窗口\">在途拦截的窗口</h3><p>在途拦截是一个时间窗很窄的动作。包裹一旦妥投，就只能走&quot;通知 + 回收&quot;路径，成本与完成率都会明显变差。因此召回决策做出后，第一步应是拉出在途订单列表并批量发起拦截。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"select s.order_id, s.tracking_no, s.carrier, s.status,&#10;       s.last_event_at,&#10;       case s.status&#10;         when &#39;in_transit&#39;   then &#39;intercept&#39;&#10;         when &#39;out_for_delivery&#39; then &#39;intercept_urgent&#39;&#10;         when &#39;delivered&#39;    then &#39;notify_and_recover&#39;&#10;         else &#39;review&#39;&#10;       end as action&#10;from shipment s&#10;join recall_affected_order a on a.order_id = s.order_id&#10;where a.recall_decision_id = $1&#10;  and s.status &lt;&gt; &#39;returned&#39;&#10;order by case s.status when &#39;out_for_delivery&#39; then 0 when &#39;in_transit&#39; then 1 else 2 end,&#10;         s.last_event_at desc;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">select</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">order_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">tracking_no</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">carrier</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">status</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">last_event_at</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       case</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">status</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         when</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'in_transit'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   then</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'intercept'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         when</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'out_for_delivery'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> then</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'intercept_urgent'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         when</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'delivered'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    then</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'notify_and_recover'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         else</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'review'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       end</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> as</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> action</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> shipment s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">join</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> recall_affected_order a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">on</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">order_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">order_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">where</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">recall_decision_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  and</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'returned'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">order by</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> case</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> when</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'out_for_delivery'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> then</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> when</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'in_transit'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> then</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> else</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> end</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">last_event_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> desc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>用 <code>case</code> 排优先级，是因为承运商接口通常有速率限制，而&quot;派送中&quot;的包裹窗口只有几小时。把最紧急的先发出去，比按订单号顺序批量处理有效得多。</p>\n<h2 id=\"退款执行的幂等与计算\">退款执行的幂等与计算</h2><p>退款是召回中资金风险最集中的环节，必须同时满足两个要求：不能重复发放，不能算错金额。</p>\n<h3 id=\"幂等键的设计\">幂等键的设计</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"create table recall_remedy (&#10;  id             bigserial primary key,&#10;  recall_decision_id bigint not null,&#10;  order_id       text   not null,&#10;  line_id        text   not null,&#10;  consumer_id    text   not null,&#10;  remedy_type    text   not null check (remedy_type in (&#39;refund&#39;,&#39;repair&#39;,&#39;replace&#39;)),&#10;  amount_cents   bigint,&#10;  currency       text,&#10;  idempotency_key text  not null,&#10;  status         text   not null check (status in (&#39;requested&#39;,&#39;approved&#39;,&#39;paid&#39;,&#39;rejected&#39;,&#39;reversed&#39;)),&#10;  requested_at   timestamptz not null default now(),&#10;  paid_at        timestamptz,&#10;  unique (idempotency_key)&#10;);&#10;&#10;create unique index recall_remedy_uniq_active&#10;  on recall_remedy (recall_decision_id, line_id)&#10;  where status in (&#39;requested&#39;,&#39;approved&#39;,&#39;paid&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">create</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> table</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> recall_remedy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  id             </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigserial</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> primary key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  recall_decision_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigint</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> not null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  order_id       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   not null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  line_id        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   not null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  consumer_id    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   not null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  remedy_type    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   not null</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> check</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (remedy_type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'refund'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'repair'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'replace'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  amount_cents   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  currency       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  idempotency_key </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  not null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   not null</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> check</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'requested'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'approved'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'paid'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'rejected'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'reversed'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  requested_at   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">timestamptz</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> not null</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  paid_at        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">timestamptz</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  unique</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (idempotency_key)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">create</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> unique index</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> recall_remedy_uniq_active</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> recall_remedy (recall_decision_id, line_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  where</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'requested'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'approved'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'paid'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这里同时用了两个约束。<code>idempotency_key</code> 防的是同一次请求被重复提交（网络重试、用户连点）；部分唯一索引 <code>recall_remedy_uniq_active</code> 防的是同一订单行被发放两次补救——这在多渠道并发申请时非常容易出现，比如消费者同时走了邮件申请与客服工单两条路。用部分索引而不是普通唯一索引，是为了允许&quot;先被拒绝、后申诉通过&quot;这类合法的多次记录。</p>\n<h3 id=\"退款的金额计算\">退款的金额计算</h3><p>退款金额不是简单返回原价。法规允许在消费者持有商品一年以上时，对退款做合理的使用扣除。这个规则应当写成确定性的计算函数，而不是客服的自由裁量。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"refund_amount(order_price, paid_at, recall_notice_at):&#10;    held_days = (recall_notice_at - paid_at).days&#10;    base = order_price&#10;    if held_days &gt;= 365:&#10;        deduction_rate = min(0.30, 0.05 + floor((held_days - 365) / 180) * 0.05)&#10;        base = order_price * (1 - deduction_rate)&#10;    return round(base, 2)   # 扣除上限与档位由内部政策设定，须在公告中披露&#10;&#10;不变式:&#10;    0 &lt;= refund_amount &lt;= order_price&#10;    同一 line 的两次调用结果必须相同（纯函数，不依赖调用时刻）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>refund_amount(order_price, paid_at, recall_notice_at):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    held_days = (recall_notice_at - paid_at).days</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    base = order_price</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if held_days >= 365:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        deduction_rate = min(0.30, 0.05 + floor((held_days - 365) / 180) * 0.05)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        base = order_price * (1 - deduction_rate)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return round(base, 2)   # 扣除上限与档位由内部政策设定，须在公告中披露</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>不变式:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    0 &#x3C;= refund_amount &#x3C;= order_price</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    同一 line 的两次调用结果必须相同（纯函数，不依赖调用时刻）</span></span></code></pre></div><p>把扣除档位写进公告并在计算函数中固定，同时保证函数是纯函数（只依赖订单与公告日期，不依赖&quot;今天是哪天&quot;），可以让对账时任何一笔退款都可复算。用&quot;当前日期&quot;参与计算是一个隐蔽的陷阱：它会让同一笔退款在不同时间算出不同结果，事后审计时无法自证。</p>\n<h2 id=\"回收品的处置与举证\">回收品的处置与举证</h2><p>回收回来的商品必须走一条有证据的处置链。监管在批准终止召回前，通常需要看到处置证明。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>处置方式</th>\n<th>证据要求</th>\n<th>系统字段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>销毁</td>\n<td>销毁证明、日期、数量、执行方</td>\n<td><code>disposition=&#39;destroy&#39;</code> + 证明附件 URI</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>返工</td>\n<td>返工记录、复检报告</td>\n<td><code>disposition=&#39;rework&#39;</code> + 复检报告 URI</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>退供应商</td>\n<td>退货单、责任追偿记录</td>\n<td><code>disposition=&#39;return_to_supplier&#39;</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>返工这条路径要格外小心：返工后的商品必须有<strong>新的批次标识</strong>，不能沿用原批次号。沿用原批次号会造成两个后果——已召回的批号出现在市场上，看起来像是召回失效；以及复检记录无法与原件区分。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"返工批次重标识规则:&#10;  原批次: LOT-SZX2609L02&#10;  返工批次: RW-&lt;原批次&gt;-&lt;返工序号&gt;   例: RW-SZX2609L02-01&#10;  约束:&#10;    1. 返工批次必须绑定复检报告后才能上架&#10;    2. 返工批次不得与原批次共用追溯记录&#10;    3. 返工件数量 &lt;= 回收件数量&#10;    4. 复检不合格件必须转入销毁流程，不得二次返工\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>返工批次重标识规则:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  原批次: LOT-SZX2609L02</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  返工批次: RW-&#x3C;原批次>-&#x3C;返工序号>   例: RW-SZX2609L02-01</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  约束:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    1. 返工批次必须绑定复检报告后才能上架</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    2. 返工批次不得与原批次共用追溯记录</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    3. 返工件数量 &#x3C;= 回收件数量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    4. 复检不合格件必须转入销毁流程，不得二次返工</span></span></code></pre></div><p>第 4 条是硬性的一刀切。允许对同一件商品反复返工，等于把不合格品无限次送回市场，是召回执行中最危险的一种&quot;节约成本&quot;做法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"渠道与第三方卖家的协同\">渠道与第三方卖家的协同</h2><p>平台型业务中，受影响商品可能同时在自营渠道与第三方卖家手中。第三方卖家往往不愿承担下架与退款成本，因此需要在协议层面预先约定：平台可基于安全理由单方下架并冻结结算，卖家须配合回收，成本按责任归属分摊。</p>\n<p>这个约定的工程落点是&quot;供应商责任追偿&quot;表：把召回总成本按批次归属拆分到责任供应商，形成可对账的追偿单据。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"create table recall_cost_allocation (&#10;  id             bigserial primary key,&#10;  recall_decision_id bigint not null,&#10;  cost_type      text   not null check (cost_type in (&#39;refund&#39;,&#39;logistics&#39;,&#39;destruction&#39;,&#39;labor&#39;,&#39;fine&#39;)),&#10;  amount_cents   bigint not null,&#10;  borne_by       text   not null,   -- platform | supplier | carrier | shared&#10;  supplier_id    text,&#10;  evidence_uri   text,&#10;  created_at     timestamptz not null default now()&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">create</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> table</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> recall_cost_allocation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  id             </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigserial</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> primary key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  recall_decision_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigint</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> not null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  cost_type      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   not null</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> check</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (cost_type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'refund'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'logistics'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'destruction'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'labor'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'fine'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  amount_cents   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigint</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> not null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  borne_by       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   not null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- platform | supplier | carrier | shared</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  supplier_id    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  evidence_uri   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  created_at     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">timestamptz</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> not null</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>把成本按类型拆分而不是记一个总额，是因为追偿谈判时每一类的可归责性差异很大：物流成本通常是共担，销毁成本与产品缺陷直接相关，罚款则要看合同约定的合规责任条款。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>召回执行本质是对账：出厂量 = 已处置 + 在途 + 消费者手中 + 差额，差额必须为零。</li>\n<li>在途拦截窗口极窄，应按物流状态而非订单号排优先级。</li>\n<li>退款需幂等（双约束）且金额计算必须为纯函数。</li>\n<li>返工商品必须重新赋批次并完成复检，不合格件不得二次返工。</li>\n<li>处置链要有证据，销毁、返工、退供应商三种路径各自的凭证不同。</li>\n<li>平台需在协议层预置单方下架与成本分摊条款。</li>\n<li>执行完之后的完成率度量与幻灯片复盘见 <a href=\"../recall-governance/recall-cost-brand-impact\">召回成本、品牌影响与改进闭环</a>。</li>\n<li>受影响买家如何定位见 <a href=\"affected-batch-buyer-reach\">批次/序列号定位与买家反查</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>参考来源：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.law.cornell.edu/uscode/text/15/2064\">15 U.S.C. § 2064 — Cornell LII</a>（第 15(d) 条修复/更换/退款三种补救与纠正行动计划、第 15(e) 条消费者不得被收费且须报销合理可预见费用、持有一年以上可合理扣除）</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.law.cornell.edu/uscode/text/15/2069\">15 U.S.C. § 2069 — Cornell LII</a>（民事罚款额度与按日计违规）</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://europa.eu/youreurope/business/product-rules-compliance/product-safety-and-liability/selling-products-safely/index_en.htm\">Selling products safely in the EU — Your Europe</a>（企业可销毁、撤回或召回产品以防止事故）</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"停售/下架/回收/维修/退款执行","id":"停售-下架-回收-维修-退款执行"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：召回是一场对账","id":"核心概念-召回是一场对账"},{"level":2,"text":"四个执行动作的落地要点","id":"四个执行动作的落地要点"},{"level":3,"text":"在途拦截的窗口","id":"在途拦截的窗口"},{"level":2,"text":"退款执行的幂等与计算","id":"退款执行的幂等与计算"},{"level":3,"text":"幂等键的设计","id":"幂等键的设计"},{"level":3,"text":"退款的金额计算","id":"退款的金额计算"},{"level":2,"text":"回收品的处置与举证","id":"回收品的处置与举证"},{"level":2,"text":"渠道与第三方卖家的协同","id":"渠道与第三方卖家的协同"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"批次/序列号定位与买家反查（联120）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-safety-incident-recall-gpsr/recall-execution/affected-batch-buyer-reach"},"next":{"title":"召回预案与时效演练","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-safety-incident-recall-gpsr/recall-governance/recall-playbook-drill"}}